# Physios & Chiropractors – Niche Landing Page Content

## 1. Niche Overview & Positioning

This niche covers independent physiotherapy and chiropractic clinics, often with a small team of
clinicians working from one or a handful of sites. Revenue is driven by assessments, follow-up
appointments and treatment plans that require patients to attend consistently over time.

Clinicians are under pressure to deliver hands-on care while also handling intake forms, triage
questions, reminders and rebooking. Missed appointments, poor follow-up and lost paperwork
harm both outcomes and income. Automation helps by streamlining intake, sending timely
reminders and nudging patients to stay on track with their treatment plans.

