## 6. Bundle / Counter-Product Definition

The ‘Smart Intake & Rebooking Hub’ is a productised automation bundle for physio and
chiropractic clinics. It streamlines digital intake, reminders, rebooking and win-back journeys in a
way that respects clinical workflows and patient relationships.

## 7. Bundle & Counter-Product Bullets

- Automates digital intake for new patients so key information is collected upfront.
- Sends clear reminders and preparation instructions before appointments.
- Makes rescheduling easier for patients while keeping diaries accurate.
- Nudges patients to book follow-up sessions in line with treatment plans.
- Runs gentle win-back campaigns for lapsed patients who could benefit from returning.
- Provides simple visibility over attendance patterns and patient activity.

